GeoNames place names (geo grouping, plan section 20)
----------------------------------------------------
Place names shown by geo grouping come from the GeoNames geographical database,
https://www.geonames.org/ ("cities1000" table: populated places with more than
1000 inhabitants, as packaged in the reverse_geocoder crate 4.1.1).

  Data: GeoNames, licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 License
  (CC BY 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
  Attribution: "Place names: GeoNames (www.geonames.org), CC BY 4.0"

The data is used offline. Unswiper never sends locations anywhere.

